  abilityId: 2850558
  abilityName: Mainspring Finale
  abilityDesc: 26 combo Light attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    adds Light shield for 4 turns, boosts Def, Rec relative to Atk for 4 turns, fills
    BB gauge for 4 turns, boosts own Atk for 4 turns & boosts own spark damage for
    4 turns
